        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Where Blood and Fire Bring Rest, The Shining, The Prophecy, To Think of You, Ravage Ritual\n- People: Stephen King\n- Topics: film samples, adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- Stephen King wrote the 1977 novel \"The Shining,\" which was later adapted into the film \"The Shining.\"\n- The album \"Where Blood and Fire Bring Rest\" contains a sample from the film \"The Shining\" at the beginning of the song \"To Think of You.\"\n- The album \"Where Blood and Fire Bring Rest\" contains a sample from the horror film \"The Prophecy\" during the intro to the song \"Ravage Ritual.\"",
